toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Steps_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Dialogue_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_notes\">Gameplay notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This quest has two parts.</li>\n<li>This quest unlocks the Phantom: <a href=\"/wiki/Kerasaur\" title=\"Kerasaur\">Kerasaur</a></li>\n<li>Listen to the Illusions award <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\">Exploration: Rinascita</a> trophy <a href=\"/wiki/Yesterday%27s_Battle_Marks\" title=\"Yesterday&#39;s Battle Marks\">Yesterday's Battle Marks</a>.</li>\n<li>Defeating the Phantom awards the <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\">Exploration: Rinascita</a> trophy <a href=\"/wiki/Fading_Maroon\" title=\"Fading Maroon\">Fading Maroon</a></li>\n<li>Completing the quest awards the <a href=\"/wiki/World_in_All_Its_Variety_I\" title=\"World in All Its Variety I\">World in All Its Variety I</a> trophy <a href=\"/wiki/A_Gladiator_Decided_to_Die\" title=\"A Gladiator Decided to Die\">A Gladiator Decided to Die</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dream_Of_A_Rusted_Sword:_Part_I\">Dream Of A Rusted Sword: Part I</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ol><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"m